\f0\fs24 \cf2 <$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Dr Kathy Logan went among the Elvi. It wasn\'92t hard to find candidates for her research; they were mostly in the act of heeding the words of the Great Teacher as she encountered them, and encountering them was a public doddle too. \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
She attended parties at Chanta\'92s penthouse, though Hayley refused to attend. As the days progressed, the bolder she got. The less said about what she collected, and how, is probably the better, though suffice to say she became emboldened to forgo the asking permission part. Her standard warnings of, \'93Medical research, coming through\'94 and \'93Hold still. You will feel a small prick,\'94 were generally considered insufficient and, at the very least, ambiguous, until the \'93volunteer\'94 recognised her as Holy Aunt Kathy. Mostly, they just got on with the rhythm of what they were doing and hardly missed a beat.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 Each morning, Kathy returned to Sublime Point with samples on the cover-copt that had, by then, become on permanent stand-by. The word spread of Holy Aunt Kathy\'92s tireless work to find a cure for pox afflicting the Elvi. By the third day, Elvi queued at medical centres and and surgeries through the Ghetto to contribute blood samples for the effort.\
Eloise reassigned a dozen researchers from a bioweapons lab elsewhere in the underground Ruined Castle sprawl\'97a project she casually described to Kathy as \'93how to regulate itches that eat people alive\'94, and which Kathy took as a project that was concerned with how to deploy a thing that already exists. The researchers immediately took to managing as many diagnostic instruments as they could unpack. Even so, the samples coming back from the Ghetto was overwhelming.\
Hayley led a team of data mechanics and scientologists to compile the specimen data and test results, and integrate it with the identity nodes in Parliament\'92s humpological database.\
Rumours that a meta-science of hump-ontology grew out of this work have never been verified.\
After the inauguration, Chanta\'92s were the first samples that Kathy processed; \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 she tried not to wince about how generous he\'92d been with them. As Kathy suspected, the digital PCR measured  extremely high levels of Chilli floating in his cells. That confirmed he was nearer to Patient Zero than anyone she\'92d tested for Chilli, if he was not Patient Zero himself. Kathy\'92s mind wobbled through a few dimensions for a moment, and she wondered if she\'92d bungled her patch dosage.\
She\'92d need to start DNA sequencing. Fine; she\'92d always intended to anyway.\
The results made her nod with satisfaction of one mystery solved, while making her quake about the implications. The sequencer displayed a section of a complex molecule and revolved it for Kathy to get a good look.\
Kathy leapt off her stool. Chilli was integrated into Chanta\'92s DNA.\
There could be others. Kathy would have to look for others, knowing that if she found none, that would still not prove that Chanta was the only source. If he was the only source, then he was irritatingly right about launching the Humpenings. Sexual transmission was an obvious treatment hypothesis, and, in the world of drug design, relatively harmless in letting loose early.\
The place to look for other sources would be among those with the highest levels of Chilli and their sexual relation graphs. They\'92d all either link back to Chanta, or they would not. The samples she was obtaining from Chanta\'92s parties would likely be the most illuminating (assuming Chanta couldn\'92t possible entertain 
\f2\i all 
\f1\i0 his guests to the same level of attention.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 If Hayley was reluctant to join Kathy on her bacchanalian field trips, she was a trooper in compiling the data. As \'93Holy Aunt Hayley\'94, and with the assistance of the Elvi Parliament and the High Elvis himself, she distributed a census through the Ghetto that essentially asked one key question: 
\f2\i Who have you humped in the previous twelve months?
\f1\i0  Campaigns went out on the anti-social media platforms and, since they contained the keywords 
\fs20 ELVI, DEATH, 
\fs22 and 
\fs20 HUMPING
\f2\i , 
\f1\i0\fs22 they went straight to the top of every Elvi\'92s feed. And since it had come from Holy Aunt Hayley, all took solemn notice of the campaigns\'92 instructions to be accurate about the information they shared in the census.\
